WEBVTT

00:08.900 --> 00:13.420
Your Highness, standing out in the sea breeze
too long may affect your health.

00:14.100 --> 00:16.360
Yes, I'll go inside.

00:20.020 --> 00:23.880
In truth, I am still against your decision 
to visit this place personally.

00:23.880 --> 00:25.050
Enough.

02:05.430 --> 02:11.440
Thank you for attending both the 
debut ceremony and the evening ball.

02:11.440 --> 02:12.730
Oh, not at all.

02:12.730 --> 02:16.410
Thank you kindly for inviting me.

02:16.410 --> 02:21.090
Has anyone been pestering you
 since then, Lady Sei?

02:21.090 --> 02:23.560
No. At least, not as of yet.

02:23.560 --> 02:24.690
Glad to hear it.

02:24.690 --> 02:28.770
I will take care of anyone 
who may cause you problems.

02:28.770 --> 02:30.420
Thank you.

02:35.610 --> 02:39.140
There is yet another reason 
I called you here today.

02:39.140 --> 02:43.120
We are preparing receive an exchange 
student from abroad.

02:43.530 --> 02:45.640
He is a prince of one of our trade partners.

02:45.640 --> 02:49.270
This turn of events is most 
unprecedented, you see.

02:49.270 --> 02:51.510
A prince, you say?

02:51.510 --> 02:54.740
We received the request rather suddenly.

02:54.740 --> 02:57.330
The prince wishes to attend 
the royal academy

02:57.330 --> 03:00.200
while observing our 
various research facilities.

03:00.590 --> 03:04.660
Is the Medicinal Flora Research 
Institute on the list?

03:05.940 --> 03:08.630
That is precisely what I wished to discuss.

03:08.940 --> 03:11.250
You mean about Sei?

03:11.250 --> 03:12.100
Yes.

03:14.780 --> 03:18.550
Your powers are a national secret.

03:18.550 --> 03:24.020
We would like to keep your interactions
with the exchange student to a minimum

03:24.020 --> 03:27.520
in order to safeguard knowledge
of the Holy Saint's power.

03:27.520 --> 03:35.490
We were hoping you would stay in the royal 
palace while the exchange student is here.

03:35.490 --> 03:40.420
Does that mean I can't go 
to the Institute during that time?

03:41.360 --> 03:43.430
That would be difficult.

03:43.430 --> 03:47.730
Sei needs to monitor the herbs
she's growing in her garden.

03:48.720 --> 03:51.550
And she's ill at ease when she's not working,

03:51.550 --> 03:54.180
though I honestly wish she'd 
take a break sometime.

03:55.030 --> 03:56.420
You got me...

03:56.800 --> 04:01.390
Allow us to discuss this more thoroughly
 after we return to the Institute.

04:01.770 --> 04:03.600
My apologies for the trouble.

04:03.600 --> 04:05.310
Oh, think nothing of it!

04:05.700 --> 04:09.560
By the way, what country
does this prince hail from?

04:09.560 --> 04:12.020
An empire called Zaidera.

04:13.740 --> 04:15.620
Zaidera?

04:16.490 --> 04:19.450
"The Imperial Prince"

04:28.960 --> 04:30.580
Hey, Sei.

04:30.860 --> 04:32.040
What?

04:32.040 --> 04:37.640
Wasn't that ship captain you met 
in Morgenhaffen from Zaidera?

04:37.640 --> 04:39.890
Now that you mention it, yeah...

04:41.760 --> 04:45.380
Does that mean this is a result
 of the potion you gave him?

04:47.290 --> 04:49.310
Please don't mention that.

04:49.910 --> 04:51.350
What about a potion?

04:56.000 --> 04:57.690
Your potions, hmm?

04:58.150 --> 05:00.930
I'm sure His Majesty suspects as much, too.

05:00.930 --> 05:02.570
He does?

05:02.570 --> 05:05.840
Didn't you have knights 
bodyguard you on that trip?

05:05.840 --> 05:08.430
No matter how close they are to you,

05:08.430 --> 05:10.620
they should have reported everything.

05:10.620 --> 05:13.070
Of course.

05:13.070 --> 05:15.090
I didn't ask them to keep it a secret.

05:17.840 --> 05:23.550
It sounds like I really shouldn't be here
while the prince is visiting after all.

05:23.550 --> 05:27.590
Well, we don't actually know
 he's after your potions,

05:27.590 --> 05:30.520
but all the better to avoid crossing 
a potentially dangerous bridge.

05:30.520 --> 05:34.980
So you'll be accepting 
the royal palace's request?

05:36.600 --> 05:41.330
We'll have Sei move to the royal palace 
and commute to the Institute.

05:41.330 --> 05:44.420
When the prince visits here,
we'll have Sei take a day off.

05:44.420 --> 05:46.450
That'll be the best course of action.

05:47.570 --> 05:49.240
But I'll be so lonely.

05:49.240 --> 05:50.690
Me too!

05:50.690 --> 05:53.210
No, I'll be even more lonely...

05:53.210 --> 05:53.920
Huh?

05:53.920 --> 05:58.030
I'm cultivating some
 very rare herbs right now.

05:58.030 --> 06:02.130
I wanted to record their 
growth on a daily basis...

06:13.680 --> 06:16.940
Have you heard, Sei? 
We're receiving an exchange student.

06:16.940 --> 06:20.820
Yes. I understand he plans to visit 
the Institute as well.

06:20.820 --> 06:24.780
I believe I heard he'll be
attending the royal academy.

06:24.780 --> 06:29.740
Indeed, the student council is preparing 
a formal reception for him.

06:29.740 --> 06:32.450
You have a student council here, too?

06:32.800 --> 06:36.750
Composed of highest-born noble students.

06:36.750 --> 06:39.170
Does this mean your homeland
also had student councils?

06:39.170 --> 06:40.890
Yeah, we did.

06:40.890 --> 06:44.760
I'm sure you achieved grand things
as a member of yours, didn't you?

06:47.140 --> 06:51.270
<i>Nope, not at all! I was the kind of generic
 schoolkid you'd find hiding in the corner.</i>

06:51.820 --> 06:54.730
The current president is Prince Rayne.

06:54.730 --> 06:56.760
Oh, the second prince.

06:57.570 --> 07:01.720
As the vice president, I'm personally
overseeing the preparations.

07:01.720 --> 07:05.030
I calculated the budget 
and organized the schedule...

07:06.490 --> 07:08.800
Sounds like you're as busy as we are.

07:08.800 --> 07:11.690
We're both working wonders, aren't we?

07:14.430 --> 07:17.920
I wonder what kind of person 
the exchange student is.

07:17.920 --> 07:20.140
Surely he must be studious.

07:20.140 --> 07:22.840
He's going to all this trouble just to study.

07:23.160 --> 07:25.090
I certainly hope you're right.

07:25.420 --> 07:27.240
Are you doubtful?

07:27.850 --> 07:33.030
Well, I do wonder if it's possible he caused 
a commotion in his country

07:33.030 --> 07:36.020
and he's fleeing abroad to hide for a time.

07:38.310 --> 07:42.900
Or perhaps he's a spy planning to uncover 
the national secrets of Salutania

07:42.900 --> 07:45.440
to take back to the empire.

07:48.700 --> 07:51.010
I jest!

07:51.010 --> 07:52.120
Goodness!

07:52.550 --> 07:56.230
We actually don't have 
much contact with Zaidera.

07:56.230 --> 07:59.580
I can't imagine they're very
interested in our national secrets.

07:59.920 --> 08:01.590
I'm sure you're right...

08:01.590 --> 08:05.550
That said, it'd be a different story 
if you were involved.

08:05.550 --> 08:06.550
Huh?

08:06.550 --> 08:07.510
Huh?

08:33.310 --> 08:36.160
You look quite nervous, my lady.

08:36.160 --> 08:40.000
Does it displease you to join the reception
 in the royal audience chamber?

08:40.000 --> 08:43.270
No, I've already accepted that much...

08:43.270 --> 08:47.590
Your status more than earns you
a place by His Majesty's side.

08:49.730 --> 08:54.220
I'm sure the people of Zaidera 
are aware we have a Holy Saint.

08:54.220 --> 08:58.060
This is just another part of my duties.

08:58.390 --> 09:02.060
My, then what has you so bothered?

09:02.060 --> 09:05.520
You'll be able to hide behind this veil.

09:05.850 --> 09:11.520
Yes. I had Grand Magus Drewes enchant it
with magic that obscures the wearer.

09:11.520 --> 09:16.830
I'm confident the imperial prince
won't be able to see my face.

09:17.960 --> 09:22.290
It's amazing you'd even think 
to request such a thing, Lady Sei.

09:22.290 --> 09:24.120
Oh, don't say that.

09:24.120 --> 09:29.010
This veil's going to make it hard
 for me to see, too.

09:30.720 --> 09:35.460
I'm glad they prepared an escort
to take me to the audience chamber,

09:35.460 --> 09:37.430
but I'm still a little nervous.

09:37.430 --> 09:40.390
I see. So that's what it is.

09:42.350 --> 09:45.810
Commander Hawke of the 
Third Order of Knights has arrived.

09:47.270 --> 09:50.260
Sounds like you can relax
 since it's someone you know.

09:50.260 --> 09:54.740
Th-That's true, but I wasn't
mentally prepared to see him either!

10:04.580 --> 10:05.790
You look beautiful.

10:07.230 --> 10:09.000
Thank you very much.

10:09.000 --> 10:12.100
Please allow me the honor of escorting you.

10:12.410 --> 10:14.970
If you'd be so kind.

10:14.970 --> 10:19.330
<i>Check me out, not getting flustered
by the commander's compliments!</i>

10:26.480 --> 10:28.610
She's as beautiful as a bride!

10:31.910 --> 10:35.410
Does that make me the groom?

10:36.870 --> 10:39.830
Now, let us be off to our wedding, my bride.

11:02.810 --> 11:07.260
<i>He's already back to work mode. So unfair...</i>

11:10.770 --> 11:14.680
Announcing the arrival 
of Imperial Prince Ten'yuu!

11:23.580 --> 11:26.420
<i>That's Prince Ten'yuu?</i>

11:38.350 --> 11:39.920
<i>Was that just my imagination?</i>

11:43.810 --> 11:48.560
Prince Ten'yuu seems to be 
a rather serious man after all.

11:48.560 --> 11:51.810
He's already attending classes 
at the academy, isn't he?

11:51.810 --> 11:53.750
Does he match his first impression?

11:53.750 --> 12:00.400
He is very polite and gentlemanly. 
He's already made many friends.

12:01.240 --> 12:04.450
He's older than you, isn't he?

12:04.450 --> 12:06.350
That's correct.

12:06.350 --> 12:12.170
He is Zaidera's eighteenth prince,
son of the emperor's seventh concubine.

12:12.170 --> 12:14.040
The eighteenth prince...?

12:14.590 --> 12:17.910
I don't know what that makes
 the prince's political standing,

12:17.910 --> 12:20.490
but that's a lot of wives for one husband.

12:21.140 --> 12:24.850
Salutania believes in one wife 
and one husband,

12:24.850 --> 12:26.600
so you've nothing to worry about.

12:29.060 --> 12:30.740
Wh-What are you saying?

12:30.740 --> 12:33.730
Goodness me. Who knows?

12:33.730 --> 12:35.140
Honestly!

12:35.140 --> 12:36.610
We have more important things at hand!

12:37.900 --> 12:39.200
My apologies.

12:45.290 --> 12:48.530
Prince Ten'yuu is knowledgeable 
in a diversity of subjects,

12:48.530 --> 12:53.290
and I have seen him discussing many things 
with other students after class.

12:53.290 --> 12:56.000
It sounds like he's most studious.

12:56.000 --> 12:59.650
Yes, and he seems 
especially interested in plants.

13:00.060 --> 13:05.260
Plants? What kind of plants in particular?

13:05.260 --> 13:07.730
He spoke about quite a variety.

13:07.730 --> 13:16.230
Flowering plants, trees, fruits, 
edible roots that can be used in medicine...

13:16.630 --> 13:21.200
Medicine? Which species did he 
say could be used for that?

13:21.200 --> 13:23.660
I knew you would ask.

13:25.620 --> 13:31.770
This is a list of everything
I can remember that he mentioned.

13:31.770 --> 13:35.090
Splendid, Liz, you kindred spirit!

13:35.290 --> 13:37.050
Sage

13:35.290 --> 13:37.050
Angelica

13:35.290 --> 13:37.050
Marigold

13:35.290 --> 13:37.050
Cinnamon

13:35.290 --> 13:37.050
Tarragon

13:35.290 --> 13:37.050
Star Anise

13:35.290 --> 13:37.050
Nettle

13:39.120 --> 13:42.270
These are indeed species with medicinal uses,

13:42.270 --> 13:45.270
but there's no focus on any particular type.

13:45.270 --> 13:47.740
I came to the same conclusion myself.

13:48.060 --> 13:50.950
Well, that's only judging by our standards.

13:50.950 --> 13:54.980
I'm not sure how the people 
in Zaidera use these plants.

13:54.980 --> 13:56.700
I see.

13:56.700 --> 14:02.480
It's also common practice for royalty
to gather information by hiding

14:02.480 --> 14:04.950
their true purpose in a sea of questions.

14:08.870 --> 14:14.230
Either way, you should be careful, Sei.

14:14.230 --> 14:17.840
I'm sure he will begin visiting 
the research facilities soon.

14:17.840 --> 14:21.150
I'm sure you're right.
 Thank you for all the information, Liz.

14:21.150 --> 14:22.550
You're always such a help.

14:22.550 --> 14:26.510
This much is nothing, my kindred spirit.

14:40.440 --> 14:44.910
It's been four days! 
There, there! Were you all lonely?

14:44.910 --> 14:47.660
Sei, what are you doing?

14:52.360 --> 14:53.940
Er, that's right!

14:53.940 --> 14:55.920
How was Prince Ten'yuu's visit?

14:55.920 --> 14:58.930
He's impressively serious.

14:58.930 --> 15:01.380
You think so too, Jude?

15:02.080 --> 15:07.590
The director said he could easily start work
at the Institute inside of a day.

15:07.590 --> 15:10.920
That <i>is</i> impressive.
Does that mean he's knowledgeable?

15:10.920 --> 15:14.210
Yeah, he even knew lots of potion ingredients.

15:14.210 --> 15:17.110
I learned a few things
 from the questions he was asking.

15:17.110 --> 15:19.000
Oh? Like what?

15:19.570 --> 15:24.960
Like if potions are made with different
ingredients and methods from country to country

15:24.960 --> 15:27.110
and if their effects differ because of that.

15:27.110 --> 15:31.230
Sounds like he's really all about potions.

15:31.230 --> 15:34.690
He talked about plenty of things,
 so I can't say.

15:37.080 --> 15:40.710
Still, why is Prince Ten'yuu
 visiting personally?

15:45.420 --> 15:47.380
Excuse me.

15:52.750 --> 15:54.740
Thank you for taking the time out of your day

15:54.740 --> 15:57.480
to give me a tour of the Institute.

15:57.480 --> 16:01.100
No, I'm glad to be of assistance.

16:01.100 --> 16:03.940
Are you a researcher as well?

16:03.940 --> 16:08.460
Er, no, I'm just a regular old passerby...

16:08.460 --> 16:09.670
Sei!

16:10.050 --> 16:14.920
Yes, I work as a researcher at this facility.

16:14.920 --> 16:16.080
My name is Sei.

16:17.770 --> 16:22.010
I'm an exchange student from Zaidera.
My name is Ten'yuu.

16:22.010 --> 16:25.840
I don't think we met 
when I visited a few days ago.

16:26.280 --> 16:30.800
I was working in a different area 
on that day, Your Highness.

16:30.800 --> 16:33.330
Ah, I see.

16:33.330 --> 16:36.790
My apologies for the 
belated introduction, then.

16:36.790 --> 16:38.680
That's quite all right.

16:38.680 --> 16:42.270
It's a pleasure to meet you.

16:42.270 --> 16:44.230
Y-Yes...

16:49.150 --> 16:52.980
Would you happen to be the one
caring for those plants?

16:52.980 --> 16:54.120
Oh, yes.

16:54.120 --> 16:57.580
They're exceedingly rare medicinal herbs.

16:57.580 --> 17:01.620
I don't believe they're native
 to this environment.

17:02.250 --> 17:07.260
You're very discerning. I had them 
sent to me from Klausner's Domain.

17:07.970 --> 17:12.720
<i>He could tell at a glance?
He must really know his medicinal herbs...</i>

17:15.140 --> 17:17.100
Wh-What is it?

17:17.100 --> 17:20.940
Other than growing herbs, 
what kind of research do you do?

17:20.940 --> 17:28.390
Um, well, I can't explain it that well, 
but it's nothing especially important...

17:28.390 --> 17:31.820
I see. How very interesting.

17:31.820 --> 17:34.780
<i>Wait, what? How? Which part?</i>

17:35.500 --> 17:37.830
Your Highness, it's almost time.

17:37.830 --> 17:39.250
I see.

17:39.250 --> 17:42.270
I apologize for interrupting your work.

17:42.270 --> 17:46.710
No, not at all.
Our apologies for keeping you.

17:46.710 --> 17:53.560
I would love to speak with you 
more intimately in the future, Sei.

18:06.610 --> 18:08.340
Did you know he was visiting today?!

18:08.340 --> 18:09.690
I didn't!

18:09.690 --> 18:10.630
Then what was that?!

18:10.630 --> 18:12.260
Why was he here?!

18:19.560 --> 18:22.250
About your meeting with Prince Ten'yuu...

18:23.930 --> 18:28.170
Reporting of it to the royal palace
 has caused a huge fuss.

18:29.100 --> 18:32.130
I'm so sorry. I was careless...

18:33.010 --> 18:35.090
Oh, no, I didn't mean because of you.

18:36.090 --> 18:41.340
It wasn't your fault.
You dealt with it as best you could.

18:41.810 --> 18:44.560
The problem is the imperial prince's behavior.

18:44.560 --> 18:46.770
What do you mean?

18:46.770 --> 18:50.860
The royal palace and His Majesty 
were both unaware of his visit.

18:51.420 --> 18:54.240
In other words, he snuck into the Institute.

18:54.240 --> 18:57.280
What?! That's a serious problem.

18:57.280 --> 19:00.200
We keep a ton of 
confidential information there.

19:01.590 --> 19:04.800
That's precisely why it caused such a fuss.

19:04.800 --> 19:07.530
Is he after Sei?

19:07.530 --> 19:12.490
I wonder. He claims he simply got lost
while going for a walk.

19:12.490 --> 19:14.300
He got lost, did he?

19:15.110 --> 19:18.560
And he just so conveniently
 happened to run into us?

19:18.560 --> 19:24.150
Still, I believe the Holy Saint's
 identity remains a secret from Zaidera.

19:24.150 --> 19:28.560
I don't think anyone would ever imagine
she's working so openly outside the palace.

19:28.560 --> 19:30.670
Yeah, no one would think the Holy Saint

19:30.670 --> 19:34.140
is super obsessed with special seedlings

19:34.140 --> 19:36.140
or a wicked workaholic.

19:36.140 --> 19:38.030
Watch it.

19:38.030 --> 19:39.950
Am I wrong?

19:39.950 --> 19:42.990
I didn't say that. Jeez...

19:43.300 --> 19:46.390
Well, the matter was settled
with but a stern warning this time.

19:46.390 --> 19:50.710
In exchange, we've assigned bodyguards 
to keep tabs on the prince.

19:50.710 --> 19:55.640
Does that mean he can't come to the 
Institute without permission anymore?

19:56.720 --> 19:58.130
That's right.

19:58.130 --> 20:00.780
Then there's nothing to worry about now.

20:00.780 --> 20:04.560
As long as we know he's coming,
we can hide Sei in the palace.

20:04.560 --> 20:06.350
Problem solved!

20:06.350 --> 20:08.350
You're free to overwork yourself again!

20:08.350 --> 20:09.890
Hey now...

20:15.860 --> 20:19.230
<i>One of his attendants said,
"It's almost time."</i>

20:19.230 --> 20:22.630
<i>Does that mean there was
a time limit on him being lost?</i>

20:29.490 --> 20:31.750
Did you learn anything, Your Highness?

20:31.750 --> 20:32.570
Yes.

20:33.210 --> 20:38.120
During my first visit to the 
Medicinal Flora Research Institute.

20:41.040 --> 20:42.730
Where's Sei?

20:42.730 --> 20:45.570
She's not working today, remember?

20:45.570 --> 20:47.990
Oops, that's right. Sorry.

20:47.990 --> 20:51.420
I wanted to thank her 
for last time. I'll come again.

20:54.570 --> 20:59.090
People clearly look up to
a researcher there named Sei.

20:59.570 --> 21:03.150
Multiple knights mentioned her
 while I was there.

21:04.140 --> 21:06.290
Is that significant?

21:07.230 --> 21:09.750
I've gathered three things.

21:09.750 --> 21:13.220
First, Sei the researcher is skilled enough

21:13.220 --> 21:16.240
that people outside 
the Institute depend on her.

21:16.560 --> 21:22.410
Second, she's important enough that
 everyone in the facility knows her days off.

21:23.180 --> 21:25.760
But third, her absence that day

21:25.760 --> 21:30.350
must have been so sudden
that word hadn't traveled.

21:31.470 --> 21:34.250
Almost as if she was purposefully
 absent for my visit.

21:35.170 --> 21:39.280
In short, she may be the key I'm looking for.

21:39.810 --> 21:41.300
I see...

21:41.300 --> 21:44.990
Well, that much is conjecture.

21:44.990 --> 21:49.000
I'm afraid my next move may be somewhat rash.

21:49.000 --> 21:51.500
Think of your status, Your Highness...

21:51.500 --> 21:57.000
That doesn't matter. I must do this, 
no matter what the sacrifice.

22:00.850 --> 22:03.370
I wish you luck, Your Highness.

23:35.020 --> 23:40.630
Next Time

23:35.020 --> 23:40.630
"Purpose"
